{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:2.110.060","page_type":"section"},"citation":"2.110.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.110.060","content_hash":"5b55944000a941599df7388b8e2d428f002c59479b30286d6e1bd3a99e92e34e","heading":"Approval of employment agreements.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.060:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.110.060","text":"Approval by the Governing Body shall be required prior to the City Manager signing any employment contract that does not follow the Human Resources Department’s process for recruitment and selection. Such contracts shall not be subject to the procurement ordinances, Chapter 3.30 TMC. (Ord. 20206 §§ 20, 86, 9-10-19.)\nCross References: City Council – Mayor, Chapter 2.15 TMC.","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"ac9198c6-9534-566f-90e2-864fec0c4697"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.110.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.110.060","content_hash":"c45d5a20e00914ffc581d2818b57f06a162bb5220bccc67c3f7e5223b033a069","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.060:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.110.060","text":"Approval by the Governing Body shall be required prior to the City Manager signing any employment contract that does not follow the Human Resources Department’s process for recruitment and selection. Such contracts shall not be subject to the procurement ordinances, Chapter 3.30 TMC. (Ord. 20206 §§ 20, 86, 9-10-19.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1e6